    m_Localized: Money
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269394388168704
    m_Localized: "<b> Warning: </b> Warning: If the box color doesn't match the product,
      packing fails and the box breaks in your hand. Check the color before you pack
      \u2014 don't waste a box."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269394430111744
    m_Localized: "<b> Tip: </b>Throw-and-catch saves time at a two-person station,
      but don't make it a habit \u2014 every drop costs you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269605470711808
    m_Localized: SHELF PLACEMENT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269605474906112
    m_Localized: "Shelves are the lifeblood of Cargor. Three types of empty boxes
      \u2014 red, yellow, and blue \u2014 are always waiting there; when you take
      one, the shelf restocks itself shortly after, so it never stays fully empty.
      If you have a spare box or a packed product you don't want to carry right now,
      you can put it back on the shelf. A tidy shelf makes life easier for you and
      your team \u2014 everyone knows where to find what."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269605474906113
    m_Localized: HOW PRODUCTS ARE PACKED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269605474906114
    m_Localized: BASIC MOVEMENT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269605483294720
    m_Localized: "<b>Walk / Run</b> \u2013 lets you move around the warehouse.\n\n<b>Pick
      up / Drop</b> \u2013 pick up an item from the floor, a table, or a shelf, or
      put it down where you're standing.\n\n<b>Throw</b> \u2013 toss what you're
      holding. Fast but risky: it breaks if it hits something hard, costing you money
      and reputation. Throw it to a teammate who catches it and there's no penalty
      \u2013 it even saves time.\n\n<b>Interact</b> \u2013 talking to customers,
      answering the phone, and picking up items from shelves/tables all use this
      button.\n\n<b>Map / Stock Check</b> \u2013 opens an overview of the warehouse
      so you can see what's where. It doesn't show your teammates' positions \u2013
      you'll have to ask over the radio."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269605483294721
    m_Localized: 'HOW

      PRODUCTS

      ARE PACKED'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137269605483294722
    m_Localized: "When you talk to a customer, they ask you for a product and leave
      it on their table. That's not the end of it \u2014 the product still isn't
      packed.\n\nPacking steps:\n\nPick up the bare product the customer left.\n\nGo
      to the nearest packing table.\n\nGrab an empty box from the shelf that matches
      the product's color.\n\nBring the product and the box together on the table
      \u2014 tape it, then label it, and the package is ready.\n\nYou now have a
      packed box. Next up is delivery (see Page 6)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859394301952
    m_Localized: Customers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859406884864
    m_Localized: "Cargor can be played solo, but the real fun starts with a team.
      A few practical tips:\n\n- <b>Split the work:</b> Have one person stay at the
      packing table, one run to the trucks, one handle customers.\n- <b>Talk to each
      other: </b>You might not see each other if you're not in the same room \u2014
      check the map and share what's where out loud.\n- <b>Throw and catch:</b> Instead
      of running back and forth between two stations, throw the box straight to a
      teammate.\n- <b>Agree on upgrades:</b> Permanent choices affect everyone, so
      don't decide alone.\n\nGood luck \u2014 welcome to Cargor!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859411079168
    m_Localized: Welcome to Cargor!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859411079169
    m_Localized: Phone Line
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859411079170
    m_Localized: "With the warehouse phone you can call the next customer yourself.
      Walk up to it and hold the button: the customer arrives right away and you
      gain reputation.\n\nBut a call isn't free \u2014 the clock skips ahead. The
      phone doesn't pay money directly; you earn money by serving the customer it
      brings with a correct delivery. Use it when you're idle and no customer is
      waiting."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859415273472
    m_Localized: "<b> Tip:  </b>As the day winds down, finish what you're doing and
      head to the rest room early \u2014 don't keep your team waiting."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859415273473
    m_Localized: Special Requests
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859415273474
    m_Localized: "<b> Tip:  </b>Don't pick without talking to your team \u2014 one
      person's upgrade choice changes how everyone plays."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859415273475
    m_Localized: "Every day you'll see a few quest offers on the board \u2014 things
      like stocking a shelf, packing a product, filling a truck, or answering the
      phone. You can only accept one per day.\n\n- If you finish the quest you accepted
      before the day ends, your reward is paid out automatically at day's end.\n\n-
      If you accept it and leave it unfinished, you're penalized at day's end.\n\nIf
      you don't accept one, nothing happens \u2014 but you miss the opportunity too.
      Pick a quest that's realistic for what you've got going on."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859415273476
    m_Localized: Teamwork Tips
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859415273477
    m_Localized: Rent and Your Money
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859419467776
    m_Localized: "Running Cargor isn't free. On certain days a rent payment comes
      due \u2014 we call that a \"rent day.\"\n\n- If you have enough money to cover
      the rent, it's paid and you carry on.\n\n- If you can't pay on the due date,
      you get one second chance: most of your cash is taken, but the business doesn't
      close.\n\n<b>Money </b>comes from correct deliveries and completed quests.
      Wrong deliveries, dropped boxes, and unfinished quests take money away."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859419467777
    m_Localized: "<b> Remember:  </b>You're not alone here. Cargor is a team effort
      \u2014 share the load, speak up."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859419467778
    m_Localized: "Deliver the right color \u2192 you earn money, your reputation
      goes up.\n\nDeliver the wrong color \u2192 you lose money. Check the colors
      twice.\n\nEvery truck has a limited wait time and capacity. When it's full
      or time runs out, the truck leaves and a new one arrives.\n\nAs the warehouse
      grows (through upgrades), multiple hangars can open \u2014 you can feed several
      trucks at once."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859427856384
    m_Localized: "<b> Tip:  </b>Don't panic when you see a mixed truck or a dual
      order \u2014 just think of it as two separate deliveries and handle them one
      after another."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859427856385
    m_Localized: Upgrades
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859427856386
    m_Localized: "When the day ends, everyone needs to head to the rest room. If
      even one person stays outside, the day won't close \u2014 it waits until the
      whole team is gathered.\n\nOnce everyone's in the room, a day summary appears
      and a new day begins. If you make it to the end of day sixteen without going
      bankrupt, you've earned the celebration."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859432050688
    m_Localized: Rest Room and End of Day
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859432050689
    m_Localized: "Customers walk in the door, join the queue, and ask you for something.
      The bar above them shows how patient they are \u2014 if it runs out, the customer
      storms off angry, and you lose money and reputation.\n\n- Traffic changes throughout
      the day: lunch and evening hours are the busiest, and you get a bit of breathing
      room in the afternoon.\n\n- When you talk to a customer (the interact button),
      they leave the product they want on their table \u2014 after that it's packing
      and delivery (Pages 4-6).\n\n- Every customer you serve on time earns you both
      money and reputation. The higher your reputation, the more you earn per delivery."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859436244992
    m_Localized: '<b> Tip:  </b>Don''t put off a hard quest until the last day. The
      end of the day always comes faster than you expect.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859436244993
    m_Localized: Returns, Dual Orders, Mixed Trucks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859436244994
    m_Localized: "<b> Tip:  </b>The phone burns time \u2014 call when nobody is in
      the queue, not while a customer is waiting."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859444633600
    m_Localized: WELCOME!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859444633601
    m_Localized: Quest Board
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859444633602
    m_Localized: "As the days go by, things get a bit more complicated. You'll run
      into three new situations:\n\n<b>Returns: </b>Some customers don't want a product
      \u2014 they do the opposite and ask you to bring them a box back. The colored
      orb that appears above them shows which color box they want. Grab the right
      color from the shelf and bring it to the customer.\n\n<b>Dual orders: </b>Some
      customers want two different colors at once. The job isn't done until you've
      prepared both.\n\n<b>Mixed truck: </b>Some trucks want two different colors
      of box instead of just one. The mixed color on its body (for example, red +
      yellow = orange) gives you the hint \u2014 it shows which two colors you need
      to load."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859444633603
    m_Localized: 'Trucks waiting in the hangar show you what they want by their body
      color: a red truck wants a red box, a yellow one wants yellow, a blue one wants
      blue.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859448827904
    m_Localized: "Welcome! You're now part of the Cargor family. This place is a
      warehouse, a store, and a bit of chaos \u2014 all rolled into one.\n\nCustomers
      tell you what they want, you pack it, and load it onto the right truck. Sounds
      simple, right? If you're still standing after sixteen days, you've genuinely
      done a good job.\n\nThis notebook in your hands is what you'll turn to when
      you forget the finer points. Each page covers a different topic. No need to
      rush \u2014 take it slow in the early days and learn the system. Your speed
      will come with time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859453022208
    m_Localized: '<b> Tip:  </b>Check your cash before rent days. Don''t leave it
      to the last minute.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859453022209
    m_Localized: '<b> Warning:  </b>No new customer arrives while the queue is full,
      but the ones already waiting keep losing patience. Don''t start something new
      before you''ve cleared the queue.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859453022210
    m_Localized: "<b> Tip:  </b>If you can spot a truck's color from a distance,
      prioritize the one that matches the box you're carrying \u2014 don't walk for
      nothing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859461410816
    m_Localized: TRUCKS AND DELIVERY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137293859465605120
    m_Localized: "On certain days you'll be offered a few upgrade options \u2014
      you can't take them all, you choose between them. You can earn permanent improvements
      like an extra shelf, an extra hangar, faster movement, or longer customer patience.\n\nChoose
      carefully: some upgrades exclude each other, and some don't unlock until a
      certain day. Picks that speed up the basics in the early days pay off a lot
      down the road."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416780595200
    m_Localized: Welcome to Cargor! You'll pick up items from customers and deliver
      them to trucks. Press [SPACE] to continue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416847704064
    m_Localized: Walk up to the customer and press [{0}], then press [{0}] again
      at the table to pick up the item.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416847704065
    m_Localized: Carry the item to the packing table and press [{0}] to place it
      down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416856092672
    m_Localized: Press [{0}] at the shelf to take the right box.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416856092673
    m_Localized: "Bring the box to the packing table and press [{0}] \u2014 the item goes into the box, but it stays open until you seal it with tape."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263129
    m_Localized: "Press [{0}] at the tape station to grab a roll of tape."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144849164114263130
    m_Localized: "With the tape in hand, press [{0}] at the packing table to seal the open box."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416856092674
    m_Localized: "Press [{0}] again at the table to pick up the sealed box."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416856092675
    m_Localized: Press [{0}] to place the box on the shelf.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416856092676
    m_Localized: The truck is arriving, hold on...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416856092677
    m_Localized: Press [{0}] again at the shelf to take the package.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416856092678
    m_Localized: Carry the package to the back of the truck and throw it in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416856092679
    m_Localized: Press [SPACE] to skip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143536416860286976
    m_Localized: Tutorial completed!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
